            </note>
            <note corresp="#d404-f2" n="2" xml:id="d404-f2-content">
                <p>Diem visited India November 4–9.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d404-f3" n="3" xml:id="d404-f3-content">
                <p>In despatch 172 from Saigon, November 19 (Department of State, Central Files,
